facebookresearch/sparsh, licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-
NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC-BY-NC 4.0). Sparsh is NOT redistributed in
this repository, apart from the one Apache-2.0 excerpt recorded two paragraphs
