One such Apache-2.0 file is reproduced in part here. The file
src/dlofeel_state/models/backbones/_sparsh_import.py contains roughly 50 lines
derived from the interpolate_pos_encoding method of Sparsh's
tactile_ssl/model/vision_transformer.py, whose per-file header reads
"Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. / This source code is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0" (note that upstream's root
